msgctxt "96"
msgid "Welp, Aniki. Guess this is where we take our leave."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "108"
msgid "Thanks for clearing all this up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "120"
msgid "Aw, no problem. Anyways, me n' the boss'll pop by tomorrow. Later!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132"
msgid "Bye!"
msgstr "Ciao!"

msgctxt "168"
msgid "We should probably head home, too. It's getting late."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid "...I'm sorry, Uncle Kaz."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid ""
"It's okay, Haruka. I'm just glad you're safe. Oh, and promise me you'll "
"never get involved in something like that again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid "I won't, I promise!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid "You, uh... You heard that, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid "...Yeah."
msgstr "...Già."

msgctxt "276"
msgid "Ha! Haha! Hahahahaha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid "Uncle Mikio?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid ""
"Ya got it all wrong, Haruka-chan. We were talking about the\r\n"
"Ryudo office, not you guys!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid ""
"Huh? But what about the rent? And the food bill? You said\r\n"
"everyone eats truckloads..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid ""
"This is all one big misunderstanding. The only place they're\r\n"
"raisin' the rent for is our office."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid ""
"As for the food... I'm the only one in this town who eats\r\n"
"like a truck, let's be honest. Heh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "348"
msgid "What're you proud of that for!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid "...That's really all it was? What a relief!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid "Are you gonna be okay, though?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid ""
"Eh, we'll figure something out. First step is puttin' our\r\n"
"big boy Mikio here on a nice, looong diet!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "396"
msgid ""
"Hehehe! Well if you ever want a nice hearty meal, you're\r\n"
"always welcome at Morning Glory!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "432"
msgid "Haruka..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "444"
msgid "I..."
msgstr "Io..."

msgctxt "456"
msgid "Aniki!"
msgstr "Capo"

msgctxt "468"
msgid "Rikiya, Mikio. What's wrong?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "480"
msgid "Mikio told me all 'bout the thugs he saw our Haruka-chan with."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "492"
msgid ""
"So I swung by Morning Glory, but you and Haruka-chan were\r\n"
"gone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "504"
msgid ""
"I'd heard word 'bout these guys in Hatsumachi pumpin' out\r\n"
"counterfeit credit cards, though, so I figured they were the\r\n"
"ones Haruka-chan got mixed up with... and now here I am."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "516"
msgid "Um..."
msgstr "Ehm..."

msgctxt "528"
msgid "What were you thinking, Haruka? You could have been in serious danger."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "540"
msgid "I... I heard Uncle Rikiya and Uncle Mikio talking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "552"
msgid "About what?"
msgstr "Di cosa?"

msgctxt "564"
msgid "They were saying money was really tight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "576"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr "Cosa intendi?"

msgctxt "588"
msgid ""
"They said the cost to feed us and the rent were both going\r\n"
"up..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "600"
msgid "That we might not make rent this month."
msgstr ""

